samples.explanation:
In the sample case:
1.The total area covered by the first plate is $\pi$;
![](https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20211120/393492_1637405353443/2F9F93309150DE287BFED7A979021B11)
2.The total area covered by the first two plates is $2\pi$;
![](https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20211120/393492_1637405377805/64B6B6E3BB7C3E20AEB0441778C38A2A)
3.The total area covered by the first three plates is $\frac{14\pi+3\sqrt{3}}{6}$;
![](https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20211120/393492_1637405401939/E79F91CD86AEC8D8503AF5B030FFCC3F)
4.The total area covered by all the four plates is $\frac{4\pi+3\sqrt{3}}{2}$.
![](https://uploadfiles.nowcoder.com/images/20211120/393492_1637405408073/3D84285ADAE2567931BCA03121F71CDD)
